msgid "A spell card is not one fairness score."
msgstr "A spell card is not one fairness score."

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Fly your own rule, then hear six incompatible reviews. Reimu watches exits, "
"Marisa expression and reproducibility, Aya the audience, Nitori collision "
"stability, Eirin stimulation, while the Misty Lake fairies refuse to let the "
"whole venue contain nothing but alarms."
msgstr ""
"Fly your own rule, then hear six incompatible reviews. Reimu watches exits, "
"Marisa expression and reproducibility, Aya the audience, Nitori collision "
"stability, Eirin stimulation, while the Misty Lake fairies refuse to let the "
"whole venue contain nothing but alarms."

